Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.57,0:22:51.68,Flashback,GRACE,0,0,0,,E shoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.68,0:22:54.85,Flashback,GRACE,0,0,0,,Dritën.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.64,0:22:58.10,Flashback,GRACE,0,0,0,,Ende e shoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.42,0:23:01.22,Flashback,GRACE,0,0,0,,Një dritë e bukur.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.19,0:23:04.81,Flashback,GRACE,0,0,0,,Jeton.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.00,0:23:08.02,Flashback,GRACE,0,0,0,,Drita...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.65,0:23:10.72,Flashback,GRACE,0,0,0,,ëndrra jonë...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.44,0:23:12.85,Flashback,GRACE,0,0,0,,ende jeton...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.65,0:23:16.63,Flashback,GRACE,0,0,0,,pikërisht këtu.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.97,0:23:29.78,Flashback,GRACE,0,0,0,,Lara...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.58,0:23:32.36,Flashback,GRACE,0,0,0,,Mari.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.45,0:23:41.38,Flashback,GRACE,0,0,0,,Jeto për dashurinë, jo për ligjet.
